# API Configuration

# HuggingFace API Key (Optional - for AI-powered features)
# Get your free API key at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# Note: Translation works without an API key. AI features will use fallbacks if no key is provided.
VITE_HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=your_huggingface_api_key_here

# Note: Translation uses MyMemory API (free, no key required)
# AI generation uses HuggingFace Inference API (free tier available)
